llm_verdict.message:
{
  "plan_description": "Modify /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/00-complianceascode-hardening.conf to ensure GSSAPIAuthentication is set to 'no' (add or correct the line: GSSAPIAuthentication no). Then restart the sshd service to apply the change: run_cmd: systemctl restart sshd. This disables the unused GSSAPI authentication mechanism, reducing the attack surface without affecting legitimate SSH access when GSSAPI is not in use."
}

